    { "type": "richtext", "id": "pricing_text", "label": "Pricing text", "default": "<p>Every fabric belongs to a price tier: Core, Premium or Designer. Your price is the frame and making cost plus the fabric this piece needs at that tier's price per metre.</p><p>Not sure about a colour? Order a swatch first, and we'll post you a cutting of the exact fabric.</p>" },
